{"sourceUrl":"https://grad.neepu.edu.cn/info/1126/3970.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:55:56.433812+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://grad.neepu.edu.cn/info/1126/3970.htm","html":"<div><div>\n<p><span><span>按照</span></span><span><span>教育部</span></span><span><span>办公厅《全国高等学校推荐优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读研究生工作管理规定》（教学厅〔</span><span>2026</span><span>〕</span><span>1</span><span>号）文件</span></span><span><span>精神和要求</span></span><span>，</span><span><span>为进一步优化我校研究生生源结构，深化研究生招生制度改革，我校拟</span></span><span><span>招收</span></span><span><span>具有推荐免试资格的应届本科毕业生</span></span><strong><span><span>攻读硕士</span></span></strong><strong><span>、</span></strong><strong><span><span>博士学位</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>研究生</span></span></strong><span><span>，特制定本章程。</span></span></p><p><strong><span>一、招生计划及学科专业</span></strong></p><p><span>根据</span><span><span>《东北电力大学招收具有推荐免试资格应届本科生直接</span></span><span>攻读</span><span><span>博士学位研究生实施办法》（东电研发</span></span><span><span>〔</span><span>2019</span><span>〕</span><span>14</span><span>号</span></span><span><span>），我校拟招收取得推免资格的优秀应届本科毕业生</span></span><span><span>攻读博士学位研究生（以下简称</span><span>“</span><span>直博生</span><span>”</span><span>）</span></span><span><span>23</span></span><span><span>人</span></span><span>，</span><span><span>攻读硕士学位研究生（以下简称</span><span>“</span><span>推免生</span><span>”</span><span>）</span></span><span><span>235</span></span><span><span>人</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>招生</span></span><span>专业和拟招生人数</span><span><span>见《东北电力大学</span>202</span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>年推免招生专业目录》</span></span><span>（</span><span><span>附件</span><span>1</span><span>）</span></span><span><span>。实际招生人数以最终确认录取人数为准，未完成的硕士推免生招生计划将转入考试招生计划中招生，直博生占用博士招生计划。</span></span></p><p><strong><span>二、申请条件</span></strong></p><p><span>1.<span>中华人民共和国公民；</span></span></p><p><span>2.<span>热爱祖国，</span></span><span>拥护中国共产党</span><span>的</span><span>领导</span><span><span>，拥护社会主义制度，品德良好，遵纪守法，诚实守信，在校期间无任何违法违纪记录；</span></span></p><p><span>3.</span><strong><span><span>取得所在学校推免资格的优秀应届本科毕业生；</span></span></strong></p><p><span>4.<span>具有浓厚的学术研究兴趣，具有较强的科研能力和创新精神；在校期间参加过科学研究、国家级学科竞赛等活动者优先考虑。直博生原则上应通过全国英语六级水平考试（</span><span>425</span><span>分及以上）；</span></span></p><p><span>5.<span>身体健康状况符合教育部《普通高等学校招生体检工作指导意见》（教学</span></span><span><span>〔</span><span>2003</span><span>〕</span><span>3</span><span>号</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span>相关要求</span><span><span>；</span></span></p><p><span>6.<span>符合所申报学科提出的其他条件；</span></span></p><p><span>7.<span>符合我校</span><span>202</span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span>博士</span><span>/</span><span>硕士</span></span><span><span>研究生招生章程规定的其他报考条件。</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>三、招生流程及日程安排</span></span></strong></p><p><span>1.<span>推免生和直博生报名工作全部通过</span><span>“</span><span>全国推荐免试攻读研究生</span></span><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>免初试、转段</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>信息公开暨管理服务系统</span><span>”</span><span>（网址</span></span><span>：</span><span>https://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm</span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>以下简称</span><span>“</span><span>推免服务系统</span><span>”</span></span><span>）</span><span><span>进行，申请人应按时登录</span><span>“</span><span>推免服务系统</span><span>”</span><span>进行注册，填写基本信息及上传本人照片。</span></span></p><p><span>2.<span>申请人应按规定交纳报名费。</span></span></p><p><span>3.</span><strong><span><span>推免生</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>报名时间</span></span></strong><strong><span>为</span></strong><strong><span>202</span></strong><strong><span><span>6</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>年</span>9<span>月</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>21</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>日</span></span></strong><strong><span>-</span></strong><strong><span>10<span>月</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>12</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>日</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>，</span></span></strong><span><span>申请人将以下申请材料</span></span><span><span>扫描件（</span></span><span>PDF<span>格式</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>制成一个压缩包后发送至</span></span><span>指定邮箱</span><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>见附件</span><span>2</span><span>），</span></span><span><span>文件名和邮件主题名均为</span><span>“</span></span><span><span>2027</span><span>年推免</span><span>+</span></span><span><span>姓名</span>+<span>推免专业</span><span>”</span><span>。</span></span> </p><p><span><span>（</span><span>1</span><span>）申请攻读研究生报告（</span></span><span><span>个人自述。包括个人简历，本科期间学习、科研、实践工作简介，对读研期间学习和未来职业规划的初步设想。</span>1000<span>字左右</span></span><span>）；</span></p><p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>）本科阶段成绩单</span>1<span>份，加盖学校教务处公章；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>3</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span>外语水平证明材料</span><span>1<span>份；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>4</span></span><span><span>）申请人有效居民身份证和教育部《学籍在线验证报告》（学信网下载）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>）本科阶段获奖证书、体现自身学术水平和</span></span><span><span>科研</span></span><span><span>潜力的代表性学术论文、出版物或原创性工作成果等</span></span><span>；</span></p><p><span>（</span><span><span>6</span></span><span>）</span><span><span>诚信承诺书（附件</span><span>3</span><span>）。</span></span></p><p><span>4.</span><strong><span><span>直博生报名时间</span></span></strong><strong><span>为</span></strong><strong><span>202</span></strong><strong><span><span>6</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>年</span>9<span>月</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>21</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>日</span></span></strong><strong><span>-</span></strong><strong><span>10<span>月</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>12</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>日</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>，</span></span></strong><span><span>申请人填写《东北电力大学招收具有推荐免试资格应届本科生直接</span></span><span>攻读</span><span><span>博士学位研究生申请表》（附件</span></span><span><span>4</span></span><span><span>），申请</span></span><span>表</span><span><span>中需提供</span>2<span>名具有正高级专业技术职务专家推荐意见。同时提交学生证、本科阶段课程成绩单、外语等级证书、获奖证书以及在校期间公开发表的学术成果及参加各种学术科研活动等证明材料</span></span><span><span>扫描件（</span></span><span>PDF<span>格式</span></span><span><span>），</span></span><span><span>并</span></span><span><span>制成一个压缩包后（文件名和邮件主题名均为</span><span>“</span><span>姓名</span><span>+</span><span>推免专业</span><span>”</span><span>）发送至</span><span>dbdlyzb@163.com</span><span>。</span></span></p><p><span>5.<span>申请人应仔细核对所有报名信息，一经提交无法更改。</span></span></p><p><span>6.</span><span><span>各招生学院</span></span><span><span>应</span></span><span><span>在</span>48<span>小时内，向申请人发出同意复试或不同意复试的通知。推免生和直博生必须在</span></span><span>24</span><span><span>小时内进行回复，不及时回复的视为自动放弃，取消复试资格。复试时间、地点及要求另行通知</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p><p><span>7</span><span>.<span>体检在</span></span><span><span>入学</span></span><span><span>报到时进行，体检结果按有关规定处理。不参加体检或体检不合格者不予注册学籍。体检时考生需携带身份证。体检费用由校医院按照规定收取。体检时间由各招生学院与校医院商定。</span></span></p><p><span>8</span><span>.<span>我校根据考生复试成绩及招生计划确定拟录取名单，申请人须在规定时间内接受拟录取，否则视为放弃录取资格，拟录取名单公示</span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>日。</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>四、学制、学习方式及办学地点</span> </span></strong></p><p><span><span>推免生基本学制为</span>3<span>年，</span></span><span><span>最长学习年限</span></span><span>5</span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>其中英语笔译</span></span><span>和日语笔译</span><span><span>专业学位硕士基本学制为</span>2<span>年，</span></span><span><span>最长学习年限</span></span><span>4</span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span>。</span></span><span><span>直博生基本学制为</span>5<span>年，一般不得申请提前毕业，最长学习年限</span><span>7</span><span>年。</span></span><strong><span><span>推免生和直博生</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>学习方式均为全日制。</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>我校研究生教育办学地点为吉林省吉林市船营区长春路</span>169 <span>号东北电力大学东校区和西校区。</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>五</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>、学费标准</span></span></strong></p><p><span>我校全日制</span><span>博士研究生学费</span><span>标准为每生每学年</span><span><span>10000</span><span>元</span></span><span>，</span><span><span>全日制学术型硕士</span></span><span>研究</span><span><span>生学费</span></span><span>标准为每生每学年</span><span>8000<span>元，全日制专业</span></span><span>型</span><span><span>硕士</span></span><span>研究</span><span><span>生学费</span></span><span>标准为每生每学年</span><span>10000<span>元</span></span><span>。</span></p><p><strong><span><span>六</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>、奖助办法</span></span></strong></p><p><span>1</span><span>.<span>国家助学金</span></span><span><span>：</span></span><span>全日制研究生（</span><span><span>有固定工资收入的除外</span></span><span>），</span><span><span>硕士</span>600<span>元</span><span>/</span><span>人</span><span>/</span><span>月，博士</span><span>1300</span><span>元</span><span>/</span><span>人</span><span>/</span><span>月，一年按</span><span>10</span><span>个月发放。</span></span></p><p><span>2</span><span>.<span>国家奖学金：</span></span><span>表现优异的全日制研究生，</span><span><span>硕士</span>20000<span>元</span></span><span><span>/</span><span>人</span></span><span><span>，博士</span>30000<span>元</span></span><span><span>/</span><span>人</span></span><span><span>，具体名额按当年国家下达指标执行。</span></span></p><p><span>3</span><span>.<span>学业奖学金：面向</span></span><span><span>部分</span></span><span>表现良好</span><span><span>的</span></span><span><span>全日制研究生设立</span></span><span>学业</span><span><span>奖学金。</span></span></p><p><span><span>4</span></span><span>.<span>协助办理国家助学贷款。</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>七</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>、注意事项</span></span></strong></p><p><span>1.<span>已被我校</span></span><span>录取</span><span><span>的推免生不得列入</span>202</span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>年派遣计划，不得参加全国统考</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p><p><span>2.<span>申请人应保证所提供的材料真实，一旦发现申请人弄虚作假，即取消其申请资格、录取资格。</span></span></p><p><span>3.<span>获得推免资格的</span></span><span>申请人必须</span><span><span>在规定的时间内</span></span><span>按我校研究生院要求在推免系统中报名</span><span><span>，未按时</span></span><span>报名</span><span><span>者不能被我校录取。</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>八</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>、联系方式</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>联系部门：东北电力大学研究生院招生办公室</span></span></p><p><span>联</span> <span><span>系 </span></span><span><span>人：郎老师</span></span> <span><span>联系电话：</span>0432-64806432</span></p><p><span><span>联系地址：吉林省吉林市船营区长春路</span>169<span>号</span></span> </p><p><span><span>办公地点：东北电力大学</span></span><span>西校区</span><span><span>东石头楼</span>313<span>室</span></span></p><p><br/></p>\n</div></div>","textSha256":"e5c6d2828cac874afd2c0410a096acf2c4c9e129359c129e367abb2c5e2e5ee9","textLength":2236,"sourceSha256":"ff9cc19d5dc7b4a5705bd68e88a33b4af9d77f7d0921225eb0487c485aa11924","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[{"name":"附件1：东北电力大学2027年推免招生专业目录.xlsx","url":"https://grad.neepu.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1511720489&wbfileid=A4E263E3430676FCD63F0CEC4D3D7285"},{"name":"附件2：各招生学院老师联系电话及邮箱.pdf","url":"https://grad.neepu.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1511720489&wbfileid=C2EC2CE785BF2410E2A976CF706FC239"},{"name":"附件3：考生诚信复试承诺书.docx","url":"https://grad.neepu.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1511720489&wbfileid=88D9573321EF3DD8507B9312342C2721"},{"name":"附件4：东北电力大学招收具有推荐免试资格应届本科生直接攻读博士学位研究生申请表.doc","url":"https://grad.neepu.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1511720489&wbfileid=C8F12C3F6E7EA6B34D9B090459208ADB"}],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-c862e3f315872f3183ea","title":"2026年东北电力大学2027年推荐免试研究生招生章程","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:55:56.433812+00:00"}
